  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WETLAND &amp; UPLAND RESTORATION &amp; CONSERVATION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will carry out several actions in the Sian Kaan Biosphere Reserve: 1) Restore 100 hectares/247 acres of red mangrove forest. 2) Develop a best practices manual for road construction and road management in mangrove areas to reduce the impact to wetlands, and train at least 10 stakeholders in these best practices. 3) Reforest 500 hectares/1,235 acres of upland. 4) Increase institutional capacity to prevent and control wildfires. 5) Train fire brigades in 10 local communities .6) Educate six local communities about ecosystem values and wildfires. 7) Increase public awareness about wildfires and project goals</narrative>
  </description>
